WEBVTT

00:03:26.578 --> 00:03:30.718
to endure 
old age, blindness, and endless torture

00:03:30.718 --> 00:03:33.500
for giving away 
his prophecies.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:37.178
Moved by his plight, 
the wind brothers set upon the flock,

00:03:37.178 --> 00:03:40.408
providing Phineas 
with a brief respite from his punishment.

00:03:40.408 --> 00:03:41.958
In return,

00:03:41.958 --> 00:03:47.068
the seer told them how to overcome
the terrifying trial that lay ahead:

00:03:47.068 --> 00:03:48.608
the Symplegades,

00:03:48.608 --> 00:03:53.438
a pair clashing rocks 
that reduced ships to splinters.

00:03:53.438 --> 00:03:54.342
But first,

00:03:54.342 --> 00:03:58.112
the Argonauts would have to maneuver 
past the mouth of hell,

00:03:58.112 --> 00:04:01.247
around the island 
of the bloodthirsty Amazons,